{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191", "ja": "プロローグ", "zh": "序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9d911ef0320227387317b41bbfa1404ced563a6c7edcc32599019c84491dab6", "ja": "イベントコミュのプロローグです", "zh": "这是活动剧情的序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "30639ec122eee3319edba809fcb0a3ce50c693a2ba7d83de9382c0b363490fd7", "ja": "う～ん、何を占ってもらおうかな～？\n恋愛運、仕事運……それとも、釣り運？", "zh": "嗯～要占卜什么好呢～？\n恋爱运、工作运……还是钓鱼运？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a7374d5f0447b140e2e37014b36a004edd002b4a376319d250ec10f46bf2f7e4", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nうんうん聞こえましたけど……悩み事ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。嗯嗯，我听到了……是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e729fb4d115af2f259b4c971026eea9bbb210f976259d5ad1d883b79be9d3af5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nそれが……相談する悩みを悩んでいるんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n其实……我正在为该找您商量什么烦恼而烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "df1325cf7c834154d76c0c15aa751b8dcdf62e98ebb343109dd7191835b18c12", "ja": "なるほど、深い悩みですね。\n人生相談……俺も今度、社長と話してみようかな。", "zh": "原来如此，真是个深奥的烦恼呢。\n人生咨询……我下次也找社长聊聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "9baa0700b285afbef46b19a1eb85c0352117cb8b5736d909e7247bc84a3cc856", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！\n{$P$}さん、社長さんがお呼びです！", "zh": "啊，对了！\n{$P$}先生，社长请您过去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "3a35e981c08100f6cac79f89f3a9f3d1b37d0381c07e48d9f09ad7c94081bbd5", "ja": "「是非とも試したいことがあるから、\n事務所に来てくれたまえ！」……って言ってました。", "zh": "“我有无论如何都想尝试的事情，\n你快来一趟事务所吧！”……社长是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e4689758084e32c33b4116615b483a2329c16b0d5ee290559226db17b782cd60", "ja": "試したい事？　なんだろう……\nとにかく、事務所に行ってみます！", "zh": "想试的事？不知道是什么……\n总之，先去事务所看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "fd2d5b713f22fb1f4a17279b83c024f0e47c3236b8c271af9ae5da2a67e8f41c", "ja": "はい、どんなお話か楽しみにしてますね～♪\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的，我很期待会是什么事情呢～♪\n路上小心哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "1275da4661ea9420022029ee6f768afb54d6639e36b26ceeb3c24a568cfe26b8", "ja": "ちゃんと伝えられてよかった～。\nやっぱり、今日の運勢は絶好調かも……えへへっ♪", "zh": "能好好传达出去真是太好了～。\n看来今天的运势果然超棒……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "26d1cd11942d77ef7c33e79230274f7db9f567afeea63a5e13cb81b8f15591b1", "ja": "社長！　もう1回、お願いします！\n私の将来がかかっているんですっ！", "zh": "社长！请再让我试1次！\n我的未来可全押在这上面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "e8ec15128a71b85b18ea7aba43b8e62c1785eaadc7b9d5c988297a6806c45a92", "ja": "このまま、引き下がるわけにはいきませんっ！", "zh": "我不能就这样退缩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d3784dfbce6183786ba053d1f4c999932ed00008931e5388d734758fa985e0e7", "ja": "お疲れさまです。ふたりとも、真剣な顔をして何を……\nそれは、タロットカードですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。你们两个都一脸认真，这是在做什么……  \n那是塔罗牌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "a2c02c148b57985923560ee2334ce12297bb878fd81088e432e0c33b58a4c97e", "ja": "おお、君か！　実は最近、タロットに凝っていてね。\nこれが、なかなか面白いんだよ！", "zh": "哦，是你啊！其实我最近迷上了塔罗牌。\n这个还真是挺有意思的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "17f4135ce880e0ca87c1d27eb91454d6735282d5a1b97f75320e91f930b07bc7", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん？\n……って、もうこんな時間じゃないですか～！", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生？\n……等等，这不是已经这么晚了吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "3a18862c87974e5cbb709a6bb977d1e3074619d36fdacf4d75f18ab8c2314071", "ja": "社長、すぐに終わるって言いましたよね？\nそれなのに、まだひとつも良い結果が無いなんて……。", "zh": "社长，您不是说马上就结束吗？\n结果到现在，连一个好结果都没有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2c4abc9accb2665d398bef2d266dd6c92a1fcbcf25563a2ccce79529671af9f4", "ja": "良い結果？", "zh": "好结果？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "a32135ee793ae61b032ff7dbd9b4b86b8bcecfbcc4256d84b4adfcce1ac93f89", "ja": "いやいや、それは誤解だよ。\n音無君が泣きの1回を繰り返すからであって……。", "zh": "不不，那是个误会。\n是因为音无君反复要求“最后再来1次”才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "32df0400a234cac4d449597831695004fa6c8fc89e0694facf1c293063bd3a3b", "ja": "仕方ないじゃないですか！　金運もダメ、\n恋愛運もダメ……私の運勢は散々です！　ううっ。", "zh": "这也没办法呀！财运不行，恋爱运也不行……我的运势真是糟透了！呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "57edf7581f7e57560e7ced5ea7d47773e69461402e501f684322388f6cb3ca50", "ja": "いやいや、仕事運は最高だったじゃないか！\nひとまずお茶でも飲んで、落ち着きたまえ。", "zh": "哎呀呀，工作运不是好极了吗！\n先喝口茶，冷静一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "7679b95170b3b6d3a2825c7b5b1378e2d9655ec223dac33638dd270ed866ebf5", "ja": "うう、ありがとうございます……\nいつものお茶なのに、複雑な味がします……。", "zh": "呜呜，谢谢您……\n明明是平时喝的茶，却尝起来五味杂陈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "9d1eede35473a559be31339cd8fd561182e7de9be1999a34b2852fdd40176a24", "ja": "さて、君のことも占ってみよう。\n好きなカードを1枚、選んでくれたまえ。", "zh": "那么，也来给你占卜一下吧。\n请选出你喜欢的1张牌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3667fca735d74bb8f90944b8a3d327f6750649c15b8c22df6522dca8dc1c79a6", "ja": "いいんですか？　それじゃあ……。", "zh": "可以吗？那么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_1023", "source_sha256": "d27b6b77ff16bc243a821b2dc96afb7cfc1eecb79de4d1efc1bb21f90f715d6e", "ja": "カードを引く", "zh": "抽取卡牌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f1f9ca5eccd4f758dc1b63b90871f66738899ae4cc1330470c468629d70ff3b6", "ja": "このカードでお願いします！", "zh": "请用这张卡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "3984a111379e6813844e13ac98a8957f563fce7dbd8a58c44b6e54031b90574d", "ja": "どれどれ……ふむ。君の頑張りのおかげで、\n劇場もアイドル諸君もどんどん成長している。", "zh": "我看看……嗯。多亏了你的努力，\n剧场和各位偶像都在不断成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "932ddbfb5599f4c6801be797648ab63151e57248d2e8d2e4ad29672bf22da2d6", "ja": "しかし、この成功にあぐらをかかず、\n新しいことに挑み続けるべし……。", "zh": "但是，不可躺在这份成功上故步自封，\n还要不断挑战新事物……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "38ca9cc9d38bc2364b0c87c6ce218261c1c795459d391b84a76f8cdd33fa21d0", "ja": "なんだか、すごい結果ですね。", "zh": "总觉得，这结果真是不得了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9c726d41ad7a276c58d392e248df66fe5848a50d8e2e40adf84409a5e6295fa6", "ja": "それで社長、俺の運勢は……。", "zh": "那么社长，我的运势是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "8c478b63f8cdd9c3b0a87750343f066b77de545d347115f4eb52729039d29454", "ja": "うむ。カードには……\n新しいユニットを立ち上げるのが吉と出ているな！", "zh": "嗯。卡牌显示……\n组建新组合是上上之策！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ff8825887e99787fedd77630a0ed1740f9b0e4768df14bf4e974445a1dd3ce4c", "ja": "新しいユニット……えっ？\nもしかして、今日の話というのは……。", "zh": "新组合……咦？\n难道说，今天说的事是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2007_president", "source_sha256": "2483bbd75d8a8e1e4de55b168b70b7d1f8bf6d129fe216bf7747e6601ba48c2d", "ja": "そう、実は今、新しいボーカルユニットを\n立ち上げてはどうかと思っていてね。", "zh": "对，其实我正在考虑，要不要组建一个新的声乐组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2008_p", "source_sha256": "17c12d9ccddbf7bad755b20eb59266a802a0d5f46b60eb9d615045948d286e37", "ja": "ボーカルユニット……ですか？", "zh": "声乐组合……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2009_president", "source_sha256": "412faf807b320b36baba2707836e08f24ba29d87a4962ac7ece0513e601a6f41", "ja": "そう。アイドルの魅力は、決して歌だけではない。\nだがアイドルの魅力そのものとなり得るものでもある。", "zh": "没错。偶像的魅力绝不只是歌声。\n但歌声也可以成为偶像的魅力本身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "b0448b560392903a48e48f6ff537c6498c15d29542fc2d59896913569054333b", "ja": "あらゆる情報が瞬く間に消費されていく今だからこそ、\nこのタロットカードのように……", "zh": "正因在所有信息转瞬即逝、迅速被消费的当下，\n才更应该像这张塔罗牌一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2011_president", "source_sha256": "5e8bc34545cd3565e1a18de8f783456835d14854370e8893a3bd4adf674f244e", "ja": "時代を越えて愛される、そんな『歌』を歌うユニットを\n見てみたい。……そう思ってしまったのだよ。", "zh": "我想看看那样的组合——演唱能够跨越时代、永远被人喜爱的『歌』的组合。……不知不觉就这么想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2012_p", "source_sha256": "01b8d991fcabefbadbb3a21ecec0552232239d17fdda191b82d060af10a055c2", "ja": "なるほど、なんだか深いですね。\nそういう季節なのかな……。", "zh": "原来如此，总觉得意味深长呢。\n或许正是这样的季节吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2013_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd496cd49ec1ea9259ca456609cba5bd54d734fbb63fe04e8c19f43eaa576772", "ja": "話を聞いて、私も夢が膨らんじゃいました♪\n永遠に残る歌を奏でるユニット……なんちゃって！", "zh": "听你这么一说，我也跟着浮想联翩了♪\n一个能唱出永恒之歌的组合……只是随便说说啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2014_p", "source_sha256": "557391ce0b508bb180c83eb2b637e9d2f28dc50493088a699895b084f4a453b4", "ja": "いいと思いますよ！　それならメンバーは\n実力だけじゃなく、経験もあった方がいいかな……。", "zh": "我觉得挺好的！那样的话，成员除了实力，最好也有一定的经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2015_president", "source_sha256": "c82ded36c4bb469b26956957ea2fa2be13cbf3ee7b9d8c6501447eb5908727b9", "ja": "人選もすべて君に任せるつもりだが、\nどうかね？　やってみる気になったかね？", "zh": "人员安排也打算全部交给你，怎么样？愿意试试看了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2016_p", "source_sha256": "e38d2d1c5de07e934f780b6d6065cf2ecb5e30c9d9c948d57796b81cbb1bdbf9", "ja": "はい！　ぜひ、やらせてください！\n必ず素晴らしいユニットにしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！请务必让我来做！\n我一定会打造出最棒的组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2017_president", "source_sha256": "70a679e919abc116555584a119d0581fe95eb8271f44311b8f61e5c80a51bdd2", "ja": "うむ、その言葉を待っていたよ！　\nひとつ、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "嗯，我等的就是这句话！  \n那么，就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_intro_2018_p", "source_sha256": "7d43be34da0a393c8831cc41b71bbaa78e47bdbb8f49716b1bf0877b2ce3cc54", "ja": "（揺るぎない『歌』を目指すユニット……。\nとなると、メンバーは……。よし！）", "zh": "（以追求坚定不移的『歌声』为目标的组合……\n这样的话，成员就是……好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
